<title>CROATIA: Croatia PPI slows to 0.1 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Croatia PPI slows to 0.1 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES     FEBRUARY   JANUARY	FEB '96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	    +0.1	+0.5	   0.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year			+2.0	+1.8	  +1.3</p>
<p>-- Davor Huic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
